313
00:35:28.060 --> 00:35:34.969
Fingerprint Content: The point is to stop a material concern or disagreement disappearing, just because the conversation moves on.

314
00:35:35.100 --> 00:35:41.329
Fingerprint Content: And then the second part of that is the deliberative hold.

