324
00:37:21.400 --> 00:37:38.440
Fingerprint Content: It is what happens when influence, repetition, confidence, or another agent's message is treated as though it carries authority, and that the source never actually possessed. A peer says go, another agent proceeds as if, authorization has arrived. But perhaps, all that arrived was the pressure.

